The Greek text files in this directory are released under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

They are derivatives of texts published by the Perseus Digital Library (Tufts
University) through the Scaife Viewer, which are distributed under Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike terms; SOURCES.md in this directory gives the
edition and the Perseus source of each file, and the changes made to each.
The underlying editions (Littre 1849; Blass 1892 and 1908; Marchant 1920;
Norlin 1928-29) are in the public domain.

The code and documentation in the parent directory are licensed separately
under the MIT licence (see ../LICENSE).
